    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Escape Before It\u2019s Too Late!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/d929b464c8fb08d183a4570d36c5d5cb.poster.avif?t=1749569583\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/d929b464c8fb08d183a4570d36c5d5cb.webm?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/d929b464c8fb08d183a4570d36c5d5cb.mp4?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the stranger it gets. The only way out is through\u2014if you can trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Spot the Anomalies, All of them!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/c44ba96036d4d8dad107edf27bbd02fe.poster.avif?t=1749569583\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/c44ba96036d4d8dad107edf27bbd02fe.webm?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/c44ba96036d4d8dad107edf27bbd02fe.mp4?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something\u2019s wrong, but it\u2019s hard to say what. Look closely\u2026 the mistake might be looking back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Work Together or\u2026 Get Stuck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/1ce0675312ee67d48d15b5f313155816.poster.avif?t=1749569583\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/1ce0675312ee67d48d15b5f313155816.webm?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/1ce0675312ee67d48d15b5f313155816.mp4?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need each other to move forward\u2014sometimes literally. Just hope your partner\u2019s seeing the same thing you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Explore Every Corner &amp; Snap Creepy Photos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/7a3b3c443012394fe8d51fe10b75c9a9.poster.avif?t=1749569583\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/7a3b3c443012394fe8d51fe10b75c9a9.webm?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/7a3b3c443012394fe8d51fe10b75c9a9.mp4?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t just walk past that chair or maybe there is a problem with that sofa?! Take a picture before it moves again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5. Use Tools, Not Just Brains!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/0394cd1fbeafca2603bcbf6b0c1e2655.poster.avif?t=1749569583\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/0394cd1fbeafca2603bcbf6b0c1e2655.webm?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578350/extras/0394cd1fbeafca2603bcbf6b0c1e2655.mp4?t=1749569583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t get much, just one tool and your instincts.\u2014some things only show themselves when the light hits just right.</p>",
